/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
ATKYN — PREMIUM COMPACT GLASS CHATBAR
Performance Optimized • Native Smoothness • 0px UI Change
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */

/* ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
WRAPPER
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */

.chatbar-wrap {
flex-shrink: 0;
position: sticky;
bottom: 0;
z-index: 10;

width: 100%;
box-sizing: border-box;

padding:
10px
18px
calc(12px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));

background: transparent;

transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);
backface-visibility: hidden;
-webkit-backface-visibility: hidden;

contain: layout style paint;
}

/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
MAIN GLASS PILL
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */

.overlay-pill {
position: relative;
isolation: isolate;

width: 100%;
height: 60px;
min-height: 60px;

display: flex;
align-items: center;

box-sizing: border-box;

gap: 6px;

padding: 0 12px 0 14px;
margin: 0;

border-radius: 999px;

background:
linear-gradient(
180deg,
rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.975) 0%,
rgba(252, 251, 248, 0.96) 48%,
rgba(248, 247, 243, 0.94) 100%
);

border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.98);

box-shadow:
inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 1),
inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(218, 217, 213, 0.32);

-webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(24px) saturate(1.03);
backdrop-filter: blur(24px) saturate(1.03);

overflow: visible;

-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;

transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);
will-change: transform;

transition:
background 0.18s ease,
border-color 0.18s ease;
}

/* ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
OUTER GLASS RING — INNER
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */

.overlay-pill::before {
content: "";

position: absolute;
inset: -2px;

box-sizing: border-box;

border-radius: inherit;

border: 1px solid rgba(226, 225, 221, 0.94);

background: transparent;

pointer-events: none;

z-index: -1;
}

/* ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
OUTER GLASS RING — WHITE EDGE
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */

.overlay-pill::after {
content: "";

position: absolute;
inset: -4px;

box-sizing: border-box;

border-radius: inherit;

border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.94);

background: transparent;

pointer-events: none;

z-index: -2;
}

/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
PLUS
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */

.ico-plus {
flex: 0 0 40px;

width: 40px;
height: 40px;

display: flex;
align-items: center;
justify-content: center;

box-sizing: border-box;

padding: 0;
margin: 0;

border: 0;
outline: 0;

background: transparent;

color: #64635f;

border-radius: 50%;

cursor: pointer;

-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;

transition:
background 0.12s ease,
transform 0.12s ease,
color 0.12s ease;
}

.ico-plus:hover {
background: rgba(70, 69, 66, 0.022);
}

.ico-plus:active {
background: rgba(70, 69, 66, 0.045);
transform: scale(0.95);
}

.ico-plus svg {
width: 27px;
height: 27px;

display: block;

stroke: currentColor;
stroke-width: 1.45;

stroke-linecap: round;
stroke-linejoin: round;

fill: none;

vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke;
}

/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
INPUT WRAPPER
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */

.overlay-input-wrap {
flex: 1;
min-width: 0;

position: relative;

height: 100%;

display: flex;
align-items: center;
}

/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
INPUT
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */

.search-input {
position: absolute;
inset: 0;

width: 100%;
height: 100%;

box-sizing: border-box;

padding: 0;
margin: 0;

border: 0;
outline: 0;

background: transparent;

font-family:
-apple-system,
BlinkMacSystemFont,
"SF Pro Text",
"SF Pro Display",
"Inter",
system-ui,
sans-serif;

font-size: 16px;
font-weight: 400;

line-height: 1.2;
letter-spacing: -0.01em;

color: #44433f;

caret-color: #55544f;

z-index: 2;

-webkit-appearance: none;
appearance: none;

-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
}

.search-input::placeholder {
color: transparent;
opacity: 0;
}

.search-input::-webkit-search-cancel-button,
.search-input::-webkit-search-decoration,
.search-input::-webkit-search-results-button,
.search-input::-webkit-search-results-decoration {
-webkit-appearance: none;
appearance: none;
display: none;
}

/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
SHIMMER PLACEHOLDER
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */

.shimmer-overlay {
position: absolute;
inset: 0;

display: flex;
align-items: center;

overflow: hidden;

pointer-events: none;

z-index: 1;
}

.shimmer-overlay span {
font-family:
-apple-system,
BlinkMacSystemFont,
"SF Pro Text",
"SF Pro Display",
"Inter",
system-ui,
sans-serif;

font-size: 16px;
font-weight: 400;

line-height: 1.2;
letter-spacing: -0.01em;

white-space: nowrap;

background:
linear-gradient(
90deg,
#696762 0%,
#696762 35%,
#7a7873 43%,
#f3f1ec 50%,
#7a7873 57%,
#696762 65%,
#696762 100%
);

background-size: 320% 100%;
background-position: 150% center;

-webkit-background-clip: text;
background-clip: text;

-webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;

animation: sweep 3.8s 1s linear infinite;

transform: translateZ(0);
}

@keyframes sweep {
0% {
background-position: 150% center;
}

100% {
background-position: -150% center;
}
}

.search-input:not(:placeholder-shown) + .shimmer-overlay {
display: none;
}

/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
CAMERA
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */

.ico-camera {
flex: 0 0 40px;

width: 40px;
height: 40px;

display: flex;
align-items: center;
justify-content: center;

box-sizing: border-box;

padding: 0;
margin: 0;

border: 0;
outline: 0;

background: transparent;

color: #64635f;

border-radius: 50%;

cursor: pointer;

-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;

transition:
background 0.12s ease,
transform 0.12s ease,
color 0.12s ease;
}

.ico-camera:hover {
background: rgba(70, 69, 66, 0.022);
}

.ico-camera:active {
background: rgba(70, 69, 66, 0.045);
transform: scale(0.95);
}

.ico-camera svg {
width: 27px;
height: 27px;

display: block;

stroke: currentColor;
stroke-width: 1.45;

stroke-linecap: round;
stroke-linejoin: round;

fill: none;

vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke;
}

/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
SEND
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */

.send-btn {
flex: 0 0 40px;

width: 40px;
height: 40px;

display: none;

align-items: center;
justify-content: center;

box-sizing: border-box;

padding: 0;
margin: 0;

border: 0;
border-radius: 50%;

background: #11110f;

cursor: pointer;

-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;

transition: transform 0.15s ease;
}

.send-btn:active {
transform: scale(0.90);
}

.send-btn svg {
width: 18px;
height: 18px;

display: block;

stroke: #ffffff;
stroke-width: 1.8;

stroke-linecap: round;
stroke-linejoin: round;

fill: none;
}

/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
CAMERA / SEND TOGGLE
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */

.overlay-pill.has-text .ico-camera {
display: none;
}

.overlay-pill.has-text .send-btn {
display: flex;
}

/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
CROSS MODE
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */

.send-btn.cross-mode {
background: transparent;
}

.send-btn.cross-mode svg {
width: 23px;
height: 23px;

stroke: #11110f;
stroke-width: 1.7;

stroke-linecap: round;
stroke-linejoin: round;
}

/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
PLUS MENU
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */

.plus-menu-backdrop {
position: fixed;
inset: 0;

z-index: 100;

display: none;
}

.plus-menu-backdrop.open {
display: block;
}

.plus-menu {
position: fixed;

left: 18px;
right: 18px;

bottom: calc(78px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));

width: auto;

box-sizing: border-box;

background: #ffffff;

border-radius: 16px;

border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.07);

box-shadow:
0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06),
0 1px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);

overflow: hidden;

z-index: 101;

transform:
translateY(10px)
scale(0.98);

transform-origin: bottom center;

opacity: 0;
pointer-events: none;

will-change: transform, opacity;

transition:
transform 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1),
opacity 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
}

.plus-menu.open {
transform:
translateY(0)
scale(1);

opacity: 1;
pointer-events: auto;
}

/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
MENU ITEMS
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */

.pm-item {
display: flex;
align-items: center;

gap: 14px;

width: 100%;

box-sizing: border-box;

padding: 15px 18px;

border: 0;
border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);

background: transparent;

text-align: left;

color: #111110;

font-family:
-apple-system,
BlinkMacSystemFont,
"SF Pro Text",
"SF Pro Display",
"Inter",
system-ui,
sans-serif;

font-size: 15px;
font-weight: 500;

letter-spacing: -0.01em;

cursor: pointer;

-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;

transition: background 0.1s ease;
}

.pm-item:last-child {
border-bottom: 0;
}

.pm-item:hover {
background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.02);
}

.pm-item:active {
background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
}

/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
MENU ICON
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */

.pm-icon {
flex-shrink: 0;

width: 36px;
height: 36px;

display: flex;
align-items: center;
justify-content: center;

background: transparent;
}

.pm-icon svg {
width: 24px;
height: 24px;

stroke: #3a3a38;
stroke-width: 1.65;

stroke-linecap: round;
stroke-linejoin: round;

fill: none;
}

/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
MENU LABEL
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */

.pm-label {
display: flex;
flex-direction: column;

gap: 1px;
}

.pm-label-title {
font-size: 15px;
font-weight: 500;
color: #111110;
letter-spacing: -0.01em;
}

.pm-label-sub {
font-size: 12px;
font-weight: 400;
color: #8e8c87;
letter-spacing: 0;
}

/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
DARK MODE
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */

@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {

.overlay-pill {
/* FIX: fully opaque — no blur, no translucency, bilkul crisp */
background: #3a3a39;

border-color: transparent;

box-shadow: none;

-webkit-backdrop-filter: none;
backdrop-filter: none;
}

.overlay-pill::before,
.overlay-pill::after {
display: none;
}

.search-input {
color: #efeeeb;
caret-color: #d7d5d0;
}

.shimmer-overlay span {
/* FIX: only override the gradient colors — size/clip already set in base */
background:
linear-gradient(
90deg,
#aaa8a2 0%,
#aaa8a2 35%,
#bbb9b4 43%,
#f0efeb 50%,
#bbb9b4 57%,
#aaa8a2 65%,
#aaa8a2 100%
);

background-size: 320% 100%;
background-position: 150% center;

-webkit-background-clip: text;
background-clip: text;
}

.ico-plus,
.ico-camera {
color: #d0cec9;
}

.send-btn {
background:
linear-gradient(
180deg,
#eeece9 0%,
#dfddda 100%
);

box-shadow:
inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.70),
inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
}

.send-btn svg {
stroke: #11110f;
}

.send-btn.cross-mode {
background: transparent;
box-shadow: none;
}

.send-btn.cross-mode svg {
stroke: #d0cec9;
}

.plus-menu {
background: #1e1e1d;

border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);

box-shadow:
0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.28),
0 1px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18);
}

.pm-item {
color: #efeeeb;

border-bottom-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
}

.pm-item:hover {
background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
}

.pm-item:active {
background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
}

.pm-icon {
background: transparent;
}

.pm-icon svg {
stroke: #d0cec9;
}

.pm-label-title {
color: #efeeeb;
}

.pm-label-sub {
color: #706e69;
}
}

/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
SMALL PHONES
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */

@media (max-width: 360px) {

.chatbar-wrap {
padding-left: 16px;
padding-right: 16px;
}

.overlay-pill {
padding-left: 12px;
padding-right: 10px;

gap: 4px;
}

.ico-plus,
.ico-camera,
.send-btn {
flex: 0 0 38px;

width: 38px;
height: 38px;
}
}

/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
REDUCED MOTION
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {

.shimmer-overlay span {
animation: none;

background: none;

-webkit-text-fill-color: #696762;
color: #696762;
}

.overlay-pill,
.ico-plus,
.ico-camera,
.send-btn,
.plus-menu {
transition: none;
}
}
